t:description":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Solar power production data from appointed solar power plant at Region Uppsala. The production data is presented in 5 minute resolution. The data collection has a higher resolution. Contact STUNS if higher resolution is required, see contact.\n\nParameters: Active power [kW], active energy [Wh], frequency [Hz], Inverter Power [W], Inverter total current [A]\n\nFor detailed information regarding the solar power plant at hand, see related resource and plant id as well as the referenced home page, see related resourse section."},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Solelproduktionsdata för aktuell solelanläggning hos Region Uppsala  under 2020. Produktionsdata är här presenterad i 5 minuters upplösning, insamlingen sker på högre upplösning. Kontakta STUNS vid behov av högre upplösning, se kontaktperson.\n\nParametrar: Aktiv effekt [kW], producerad energi [Wh], frekvens [Hz], Växelriktareffekt [W], Total ström Växelriktare [A]\n\nFör detaljer om anläggningen se relaterad resurs och anläggning C1 samt hemsidan."}],"dct:identifier":"https://energiportalregionuppsala.se/about?device=C1_Slav","dct:issued":{"@type":"xsd:date","@value":"2021-08-18"},"dct:publisher":{"@id":"https://stuns.entryscape.net/store/1/resource/1"},"dct:relation":[{"@id":"https://energiportalregionuppsala.se/"},{"@id":"https://www.dataportal.se/sv/datasets/763_1482/detaljerad-forteckning-over-solcellsanlaggningar-vid-region-uppsalas-fastigheter#ref=?p=1&q=f%C3%B6rteckning%20solel&s=2&t=20&f=&rt=dataset%2524esterms_IndependentDataService%2524esterms_ServedByDataService&c=false"}],"dct:temporal":{"@id":"_:85d53ab0f829079594555323f4717154a0512163d226ee7e2a846cc376b6b2bb_b0n0"},"dct:title":[{"@language":"en","@value":"Solar production data house C1 Region Uppsala solar power plant, 5 min resolution"},{"@language":"sv","@value":"Solelproduktionsdata hus C1 Region Uppsala solelanläggning 2020, 5 min upplösning"}],"http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionInfo":"första version",